	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "4982ff50-8e2b-4481-ac96-3f783c0e703c",
		"name": "BookStore API",
		"description": "# 📚 BookStore API Documentation\n\nBase URL: `http://localhost:8080/BookStoreAPI/api`\n\n---\n\n## 📘 Books\n\n### ➕ Add a Book\n\n**POST** `/books`\n\n**Request Body (JSON):**\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"title\": \"Harry Potter and the Philosopher's Stone\",\n  \"author\": \"J.K. Rowling\",\n  \"ISBN\": \"978-0-7475-3269-9\",\n  \"year\": 1997,\n  \"price\": 20\n}\n\n ```\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- ✅ 201 Created: Book successfully added\n    \n- ❌ 400 Bad Request: Missing or invalid fields\n    \n\n---\n\n### 📚 Get All Books\n\n**GET** `/books`\n\n**Response:**  \nReturns a list of all books.\n\n---\n\n### 🔍 Get Book by ID\n\n**GET** `/books/{bookId}`\n\n**Path Parameter:**\n\n- `bookId`: UUID of the book\n    \n\n**Responses:**\n\n- ✅ 200 OK: Returns the book\n    \n- ❌ 404 Not Found: Book not found\n    \n\n---\n\n### ✏️ Update Book by ID\n\n**PUT** `/books/{bookId}`\n\n**Request Body:**\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"bookId\": \"255aa6bd-ce3b-4a6d-921d-7e5239e044c6\",\n  \"title\": \"The Hobbit\",\n  \"author\": \"J.R.R. Tolkien\",\n  \"isbn\": \"978-0-261-10221-7\",\n  \"year\": 1937,\n  \"price\": 20,\n  \"stockQuantity\": 40\n}\n\n ```\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- ✅ 200 OK: Updated successfully\n    \n- ❌ 404 Not Found / Invalid ID\n    \n\n---\n\n### ❌ Delete Book by ID\n\n**DELETE** `/books/{bookId}`\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- ✅ 200 OK: Deleted successfully\n    \n- ❌ 404 Not Found: Invalid or non-existent ID\n    \n\n---\n\n## ✍️ Authors\n\n### ➕ Add Author\n\n**POST** `/authors`\n\n**Request Body:**\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"name\": \"Haruki Murakami\",\n  \"biography\": \"Japanese author known for magical realism and surreal narratives.\"\n}\n\n ```\n\n---\n\n### 📚 Get All Authors\n\n**GET** `/authors`\n\nReturns a list of all authors.\n\n---\n\n### 🔍 Get Author by ID\n\n**GET** `/authors/{authorId}`\n\n---\n\n### ✏️ Update Author by ID\n\n**PUT** `/authors/{authorId}`\n\n**Request Body:**\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"name\": \"Updated Author\",\n  \"biography\": \"Updated biography here.\"\n}\n\n ```\n\n---\n\n### ❌ Delete Author by ID\n\n**DELETE** `/authors/{authorId}`\n\n---\n\n## 👤 Customers\n\n### ➕ Register Customer\n\n**POST** `/customers`\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"name\": \"Disandu Sanhida\",\n  \"email\": \"disandu@gmail.com\",\n  \"password\": \"pass123we\"\n}\n\n ```\n\n---\n\n### 📋 Get All Customers\n\n**GET** `/customers`\n\n---\n\n### 🔍 Get Customer by ID\n\n**GET** `/customers/{customerId}`\n\n---\n\n### ✏️ Update Customer by ID\n\n**PUT** `/customers/{customerId}`\n\n---\n\n### ❌ Delete Customer by ID\n\n**DELETE** `/customers/{customerId}`\n\n---\n\n## 🛒 Cart\n\n### ➕ Add Items to Cart\n\n**POST** `/customers/{customerId}/cart`\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"items\": {\n    \"bookId\": 2\n  }\n}\n\n ```\n\n---\n\n### 📋 Get Cart by Customer\n\n**GET** `/customers/{customerId}/cart`\n\n---\n\n### ✏️ Update Cart Item Quantity\n\n**PUT** `/customers/{customerId}/cart/items/{bookId}`\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"items\": {\n    \"bookId\": 5\n  }\n}\n\n ```\n\n---\n\n### ❌ Remove Item from Cart\n\n**DELETE** `/customers/{customerId}/cart/items/{bookId}`\n\n---\n\n## 📦 Orders\n\n### 🛒 Place Order\n\n**POST** `/customers/{customerId}/orders`\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"order\": {\n    \"bookId\": 2\n  }\n}\n\n ```\n\n---\n\n### 📋 Get All Orders by Customer\n\n**GET** `/customers/{customerId}/orders`\n\n---\n\n### 🔍 Get Specific Order\n\n**GET** `/customers/{customerId}/orders/{orderId}`",
